/* Visible FAQs only. Deliberately no FAQPage schema (not eligible for this kind of site). */
---

<section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2 id="faqTitle">Before you go</h2>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I book just an Innova Crysta or private taxi for Spiti?</summary>
      <p>
        Yes. You can request private transport without a hotel package. Vehicle availability and
        suitability are confirmed for your dates and group.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Does this itinerary operate throughout the year?</summary>
      <p>
        No. Kunzum, Chandratal and the Manali side of the full circuit are seasonal. When access is
        closed or unsuitable, ask about a Kinnaur-side return from Kaza.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can we change the sightseeing stops?</summary>
      <p>
        Yes. This is a sample itinerary. Stops such as Gue, Chitkul and Pin Valley depend on the
        available time, road access and your preferences.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
